meta {
  name: Categories
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/categories
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The Plaid PFC v2 taxonomy (~127 codes), grouped by primary - 18 groups,
  each carrying one iconUrl and a detailed[] array. pfcv1Detailed (the
  sync-side v1→v2 mapping) never appears here; it's not display data. Static
  seed data, no filters, no pagination.
}
